	(text_box "IMPORTANT! Control signals are the same as PCB_E539V03A, which uses the logic inherited from the SKY66420-11 RF Front-End (RFFE):\n\n- CSD=0 RFFE shutdown (ALL OFF) [CSD is connected to CTRL0_RF_EN]\n\n- CTX=0 RFSW RX mode (LNA ON) [CTX is connected to CTRL2_RF_SW]\n- CTX=1 RFSW TX mode (LNA OFF)\n\n- CPS=0 PA bypass (PA OFF) [CPS is connected to CTRL4_RF_PA_EN]\n- CPS=1 no bypass (PA ON)\n"
